{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07903","headline":"上巳日涧南园期王山人陈七诸公不至 · 孟浩然","name":"上巳日涧南园期王山人陈七诸公不至","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"摇艇候明发，花源弄晚春。\n在山怀绮季，临汉忆荀陈。\n上巳期三月，浮杯兴十旬。\n坐歌空有待，行乐恨无邻。\n日晚兰亭北，烟开曲水滨。\n浴蚕逢姹女，采艾值幽人。\n石壁堪题序，沙场好解绅。\n羣公望不至，虚掷此芳晨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}